  "body": "Investment Option or buy now and move in later.\r\nSunny and light 153 sqm home in prestigious Ara Hills new subdivision ! AND very motivated vendor !\r\nThis new subdivision is being done by the same developer for Hobsonville, boasting upmarket designs and finishes with the development abutting the Nukumea Reserve. A brilliant design encompassing the concept of a series of villages linked with a network of walking trails, parks and nature reserves.\r\n\r\nSituated in the prestigious Ara Hills development very close to the Orewa Interchange on State Highway 1 is this lovely single level, sunny and light 3 bedroom (potential to make 4 bedrooms), 2 bathroom home with 3 living areas.\r\n\r\nQuick to get to Orewa beaches, shopping complex, Medical Centre, Schools or even to Auckland CBD.\r\nFor ease, use the link below:\r\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/LoekqXCWDds1vkPr8\r\n\r\nThis lovely home has the following features:\r\n\r\n*  3 bedrooms with great separation between master bedroom ensuite and the other 2 bedrooms\r\n*  2 bathrooms, fully tiled with wall tiles extending to the ceiling plus underfloor heating Central Air-conditioning\r\n*  Plus a guest toilet on entry level\r\n*  Stud height 2.7m on entry\r\n*  Designer kitchen with engineered stone bench tops and Bosch appliances\r\n*  The architect has achieved a great balance with spaciousness and functionality. With fantastic positioning of kitchen/dining/family room that flows effortlessly to outdoor landscaped garden and large deck\r\n*  Great privacy outside and lots of lawn for children to play. Excellent for relaxation or entertainment\r\n*  A 3 minute walk to the local area playground or 5 minutes drive to Silverdale Shopping Complex or 4 km to Orewa Beach\r\n\r\nCall Shaun now for more information  - 021 871 252",
